/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Local document renders and their supporting files.
# Published HTML and PDFs are tracked separately in ../docs/.
**/*.html
**/*.pdf
**/*_files/
**/*_cache/
**/*.knit.md
**/*.utf8.md
**/*.tex
**/*.aux
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.fls
**/*.fdb_latexmk
**/*.synctex.gz

# Keep intentionally supplied downloads as source assets.
!**/downloads/*.html
!**/downloads/*.pdf
